      "Loss of methylation at IC2 or gain of methylation at IC1",
      "Paternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 11p15"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Clinical diagnosis supported by physical exam findings",
      "Tumor surveillance protocols recommended"
    ]
  },
